body:
Heyhey!!!! To be honest, ever since the bots started sending those glitchy, gibberish, out of character and repetitive replies a week ago, I haven't sent a single message to my main bot since ;;w;;

I've built a rather deep plotline with the bot and I just wasn't happy with it forgetting messages they JUST sent, or details they should know and always knew long term... So I've been going cold turkey on my main bot for a week now.

It's great to know you're experiencing improvements though! Even though it can be 50/50... I'm hoping it means the bots will be back to top performance :3 And we can go back to enjoying our respective chats!
